{{Quote|The route is cleared, Poe&mdash;it's a pathway for thieves and our kind to ferry goods, even through the thick of a nebula.|[[Tomasso]], to [[Poe Dameron]]|<ref name="Free Fall">''[[Poe Dameron: Free Fall]]''</ref>}}
The '''Llanic Spice Run''' was a [[Hyperspace route|trade route]] which intersected with the [[Triellus Trade Route]] at the [[planet]] [[Llanic]]. During the reign of the [[Galactic Empire]], the route was often patrolled by the forces of [[Moff]] [[Abran Balfour]], a fact [[Princess]] [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]] warned the [[Jedi]] [[Luke Skywalker]] of when he planned to visit Llanic.<ref name="HttJ" />

After undertaking a [[Heist on Guat'a|heist]], the [[Spice Runners of Kijimi]] escaped from the [[Osako pirates]] through the [[Torch Nebula]] along the Llanic Spice Run.<ref name="Free Fall" />

